# Send only runtime scripts and Go sources; exclude secrets, data and local caches.
**
!go.mod
!go.sum
!requirements.txt
!cmd/
!cmd/**
!internal/
!internal/**
!pkg/
!pkg/**
!scripts/
!scripts/llm_subtrans_translate.py
!scripts/detect_hard_sub.py
# Linux transcription images (asr/): the whole package, plus the shared logging
# module the service imports. The tests and caches are not part of any image, so
# they are excluded again below — the last line that matches a path wins.
!asr/
!asr/**
!scripts/logfmt.py
asr/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
